<title>LEBANON: Lebanon's MEA stewards to stage one-day strike.</title>
<headline>Lebanon's MEA stewards to stage one-day strike.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stewards of Lebanon's national carrier Middle East Airlines will stage a 24-hour strike on Sunday over pay demands, their union said on Friday.</p>
<p>The union grouping the airline's 355 stewards said in a statement that the strike would begin immediately after midnight Saturday and &quot;will apply to all (MEA) flights to and from Beirut&quot;.</p>
<p>Beirut airport sources said there were 12 scheduled MEA flights out of Beirut and 13 incoming flights on Sunday.</p>
<p>The union's demands include the adoption of a new pay scale for the stewards.</p>
</text>
